      "text": "The paper reports water-based synthesis of two surfactant-stabilized nano-COF colloids, compares them with bulk analogues, and links improved dispersion and light harvesting to enhanced sacrificial photocatalytic hydrogen evolution. It further examines an inverse concentration dependence using photoluminescence and transient-absorption measurements, while the central novelty is qualified by a prior-art concern about the underlying materials."
